					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="763" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Super-Mario-72056-Mario-Kart-Luigi-Bowser-Jr.s-Race-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Super Mario 72056 Mario Kart - Luigi &amp; Bowser Jr.&#039;s Race January 2027 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Super-Mario-72056-Mario-Kart-Luigi-Bowser-Jr.s-Race-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Super-Mario-72056-Mario-Kart-Luigi-Bowser-Jr.s-Race-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x191.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Super-Mario-72056-Mario-Kart-Luigi-Bowser-Jr.s-Race-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x651.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Super-Mario-72056-Mario-Kart-Luigi-Bowser-Jr.s-Race-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x488.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>There are always exciting free LEGO activities and discussions happening at the Toys N Bricks LEGO Forums. Registration</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/win-awesome-lego-prizes-3-winners-in-our-forum-members-of-the-holiday-season-until-december-28-2026-and-winners-announced-for-october-2026-forum-members/">Win Awesome LEGO Prizes (3 Winners) in our Forum Members of the Holiday Season (Until December 28, 2026) and Winners Announced for October 2026 Forum Members</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>There are always <strong>exciting free LEGO activities</strong> and discussions happening at the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Toys N Bricks LEGO Forums</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is free and fast. Don&#8217;t forget to check your junk &amp; spam email/folder if you don&#8217;t see the registration activation email.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="648" height="517" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 648px) 100vw, 648px" /></a></p>
<p>In this forum update for <strong>Friday night, October 30, 2026</strong>, we&#8217;ll go over the following current activities and contests happening. We&#8217;re now into the Winter season.</p>
<p><em>Forum Members of the Month</em></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>New!</strong> <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3352-forum-members-of-the-holiday-season-2026-win-awesome-lego-prizes-3-winners-until-december-28-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">[Forum Members of the Holiday Season 2026] Win Awesome LEGO Prizes (3 Winners)</a> &#8211; Until December 28, 2026</li>
<li>Winners Announced &#8211; <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3173-forum-members-of-the-month-october-2026-win-awesome-lego-prizes-2-winners-until-october-28-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">[Forum Members of the Month &#8211; October 2026] Win Awesome LEGO Prizes (2 Winners)</a> &#8211; Until October 28, 2026</li>
</ul>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">[Forum Members of the Holiday Season 2026] Win Awesome LEGO Prizes (3 Winners): Until December 28, 2026</span></h3>
<p><a href="https://www.toysnbricksforum.com/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Toys N Bricks LEGO Forums</a> is launching our Forum Members of the Holiday 2026 Season. We will recognize forum members and they will win free physical LEGO toys! <strong>All you have to do is participate and/or share LEGO sales finds in our LEGO Forums. Let us know you are interested in participating by submitting an entry post <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3352-forum-members-of-the-holiday-season-2026-win-awesome-lego-prizes-3-winners-until-december-28-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">in this direct thread</a>.</strong></p>
<h3>Holiday Season 2026 Prizes</h3>
<p>We will be giving away brand-new copies of <u>either</u> the LEGO Super Mario 72056 Luigi &amp; Bowser Jr.&#8217;s Race <u>OR</u> LEGO DC 67009 Arkham Batman Batmobile (winners get the choice to pick).</p>
<p>There will be a <strong><u>total of 3 winners.</u> Two winners will be based on a scoring system subject to daily and weekly participation (i.e comments/posts). One winner will not be subject to this system. Further details are available below on the evaluation process.</strong></p>
<p>These sets officially release on January 1, 2027 at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Australia</a>) and has a regular retail price value of $29.99 USD / $39.99 CAD plus tax. Prizes are sponsored and paid for by Toys N Bricks.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113297 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-DC-Batman-67009-Arkham-Batman-Batmobile-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="757" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-DC-Batman-67009-Arkham-Batman-Batmobile-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-DC-Batman-67009-Arkham-Batman-Batmobile-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x189.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-DC-Batman-67009-Arkham-Batman-Batmobile-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x646.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-DC-Batman-67009-Arkham-Batman-Batmobile-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x484.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-112664 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Super-Mario-72056-Mario-Kart-Luigi-Bowser-Jr.s-Race-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="763" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Super-Mario-72056-Mario-Kart-Luigi-Bowser-Jr.s-Race-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Super-Mario-72056-Mario-Kart-Luigi-Bowser-Jr.s-Race-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x191.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Super-Mario-72056-Mario-Kart-Luigi-Bowser-Jr.s-Race-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x651.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Super-Mario-72056-Mario-Kart-Luigi-Bowser-Jr.s-Race-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x488.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><em>*A LEGO prize value of $30 USD / $35 CAD plus tax and shipping (depending on your country of residence) would be offered to the winners as an option instead of LEGO Super Mario 72056 Luigi &amp; Bowser Jr.&#8217;s Race <u>OR</u> LEGO DC 67009 Arkham Batman Batmobile (if the winners prefer alternative LEGO sets). Note that if LEGO Super Mario 72056 Luigi &amp; Bowser Jr.&#8217;s Race <u>OR</u> LEGO DC 67009 Arkham Batman Batmobile set are sold out/out of stock, a LEGO prize value of $30 USD / $35 CAD plus tax and shipping would be offered (depending on your country of residence). Kindly let us know which LEGO set(s) you want and we&#8217;ll order it for you. Please note that Toys N Bricks will usually order the prizes directly from LEGO but ultimately reserves the right to order from any other big box retailer (i.e Amazon, Wal-Mart, Target, etc).</em></p>
<p><strong>Prizes are sponsored and paid for by Toys N Bricks.</strong></p>
<p>For those entries with a paid monthly subscription &#8211; <a href="https://www.patreon.com/c/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Toys N Bricks Patreon Premium Tier, Platinum Elite Tier or VIP Signature Tier</a> (or those on a grandfathered paid forum membership account), they will get bonus points (for both prizes) as a head start.</p>
<ul>
<li>Premium Tier (or those on grandfathered paid forum membership account): +5 bonus points (or 5%)</li>
<li>Platinum Elite Tier: +10 bonus points (or 10%)</li>
<li>VIP Signature Tier: +15 bonus points (or 15%)</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-111285 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks.jpg" alt="" width="697" height="253" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks.jpg 697w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks-300x109.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 697px) 100vw, 697px" /></a></p>
<p>Our Forum Members of the Holiday Season 2026 starts now and <strong><u>ends on December 28, 2026 at 21:00 PST</u></strong> (December 29, 2026 – 0:00 EST).</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Winners Announced &#8211; [Forum Members of the Month &#8211; October 2026] Win Awesome LEGO Prizes (2 Winners)</span></h3>
<p>Our <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3173-forum-members-of-the-month-october-2026-win-awesome-lego-prizes-2-winners-until-october-28-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">October 2026 Forum Members of the Month</a> has concluded recently. Thank you to everyone for participating. We now have some winners to announce!</p>
<p>For October 2026, we will be giving away a brand-new copy of the LEGO Botanicals 10371 Cozy Plants set (scoring system based on daily and weekly participation). This set officially releases on November 1, 2026 at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Australia</a>) and has a regular retail price value of $22.99 USD / $29.99 CAD plus tax.  We will also give away a brand-new copy of LEGO 40862 Holiday Ornament Selection 2 (retail value of $12.99 USD / $17.99 CAD plus tax). This set releases on October 1, 2026. Prizes are sponsored and paid for by Toys N Bricks.</p>
<p><em>*A LEGO prize value of $35 USD / $45 CAD plus tax and shipping (depending on your country of residence) would be offered to the winners as an option instead of LEGO Botanicals 10371 Cozy Plants set and LEGO 40862 Holiday Ornament Selection 2 (if the winners prefer alternative LEGO sets). Note that if the LEGO Botanicals 10371 Cozy Plants set and LEGO 40862 Holiday Ornament Selection 2 sets are sold out/out of stock, a LEGO prize value of $30 USD / $40 CAD plus tax and shipping would be offered (depending on your country of residence). Kindly let us know which LEGO set(s) you want and we&#8217;ll order it for you. Please note that Toys N Bricks will usually order the prizes directly from LEGO but ultimately reserves the right to order from any other big box retailer (i.e Amazon, Wal-Mart, Target, etc).</em></p>
<p><strong>It was actually a very close call as there was another forum member that wasn&#8217;t too far behind in the scoring system. But the winner goes to <span style="text-decoration: underline;">forum member Marshallmario.</span> Congrats!</strong></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112635 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="750" height="873" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112351 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="855" height="855" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 855px) 100vw, 855px" /></p>
<p>In addition, we will also be giving away a brand-new copy of LEGO 40866 Santa&#8217;s Holiday Sleigh Adventure set (retail value $29.99 USD / $42.99 CAD plus tax). This set releases on October 1, 2026. For this prize category, it is not subject to the scoring system. Prizes are sponsored and paid for by Toys N Bricks.</p>
<p><em>*A LEGO prize value of $30 USD / $35 CAD plus tax and shipping (depending on your country of residence) would be offered to the winners as an option instead of LLEGO 40866 Santa&#8217;s Holiday Sleigh Adventure (if the winners prefer alternative LEGO sets). Note that if the LEGO 40866 Santa&#8217;s Holiday Sleigh Adventure set is sold out/out of stock, a LEGO prize value of $30 USD / $35 CAD plus tax and shipping would be offered (depending on your country of residence). Kindly let us know which LEGO set(s) you want and we&#8217;ll order it for you. Please note that Toys N Bricks will usually order the prizes directly from LEGO but ultimately reserves the right to order from any other big box retailer (i.e Amazon, Wal-Mart, Target, etc).</em></p>
<p><strong>Big congrats to <span style="text-decoration: underline;">forum member Daddydoh</span> for winning this prize! Thanks for participating in our LEGO forums and for also sharing the recent Eaton Center (Toronto, Canada) LEGO Store Grand Opening Event with us <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3324-eatons-centre-lego-store-grand-opening/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">in the forums</a>.</strong></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112363 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40866-Santas-Holiday-Sleigh-Adventure-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1054" height="1054" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40866-Santas-Holiday-Sleigh-Adventure-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40866-Santas-Holiday-Sleigh-Adventure-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40866-Santas-Holiday-Sleigh-Adventure-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40866-Santas-Holiday-Sleigh-Adventure-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40866-Santas-Holiday-Sleigh-Adventure-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1054px) 100vw, 1054px" /></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112959 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Forum-Renovation-Update-Revamp-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="592" height="473" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Forum-Renovation-Update-Revamp-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Forum-Renovation-Update-Revamp-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Forum-Renovation-Update-Revamp-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 592px) 100vw, 592px" /></a></p>
<p>Note that all new forum member posts are subject to moderation prior to them appearing. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">We regret that posts that are advertisements/self-promotion in nature will not be published or approved.</span> This is in the interest of safety measures as well as protecting the forum community from spam/ads/malicious links. After a certain amount of forum activity/history, new members that are not just here to advertise/self-promote would be automatically released from post moderation. Thank you for your understanding.</p>
<p>With that said, we <span style="text-decoration: underline;">do allow self-promotion/advertisements to be posted</span> if you have <a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener">subscribed to our Patreon Platinum Elite Tier or VIP Signature Tier</a>. Funds received will be used to support Toys N Bricks Forum Community Activities (i.e Building Contests &amp; Giveaways) as well as operational expenses. Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
<p>Toys N Bricks is free of charge to everyone. If you appreciate and like the work that we do at Toys N Bricks, you can <a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener">subscribe to our Patreon monthly financial support</a> starting as low as $3 USD/month. Thank you for your support.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-111285 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks.jpg" alt="" width="697" height="253" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks.jpg 697w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks-300x109.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 697px) 100vw, 697px" /></a></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="628" height="502" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 628px) 100vw, 628px" /></p>
<p>Disclosure Integrity &amp; Transparency: This post contains affiliate links. Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases made. Please ensure to accept the merchant’s 3rd party cookies (if there are any) and disable any browser extensions (if there are any) so that the affiliate link works. Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
