					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="855" height="856" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="18+ LEGO Icons 11384 Golden Retriever Puppy February 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 855w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x769.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 855px) 100vw, 855px" /></p>
<p>Are you looking for the best LEGO deals on Wal-Mart Canada Online? We&#8217;ve picked 10 of the best</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/10-handpicked-best-wal-mart-canada-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-october-30-2026/">10 Handpicked Best Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for Tonight, October 30, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Are you looking for the best LEGO deals on <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a>? We&#8217;ve picked 10 of the best LEGO sets on October 30, 2026 that features popular themes and great value for your money. Note that <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada</a> did not list the regular price for a lot of them. But we did check them with <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> and calculated the actual savings percentage for your convenience. Free shipping on orders above $35 for items sold by Wal-Mart Canada (free shipping not available for remote areas or for orders over 150lbs).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-107201 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Marvel-76340-Advent-Calendar-2026-September-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="890" height="709" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Marvel-76340-Advent-Calendar-2026-September-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Marvel-76340-Advent-Calendar-2026-September-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x239.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Marvel-76340-Advent-Calendar-2026-September-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x816.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Marvel-76340-Advent-Calendar-2026-September-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x612.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 890px) 100vw, 890px" /></p>
<p>I am the most excited for the LEGO Marvel Advent Calendar 2026 76340. Although the discount is only 5%, I think this is a great Christmas gift for Marvel fans, especially when this set is already sold out on LEGO official site. And there are lots of other great deals at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a> below.</p>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in Canada by subscribing to our email list.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">10 Handpicked Best Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, October 30, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>33% off &#8211; LEGO Harry Potter Hogwarts Castle: Herbology Class 76445 <strong>$39.97</strong> &#8211; <em>Regular retail price is $59.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> (Temporarily out of stock)</em></li>
<li><strong>Shop Now:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a></li>
</ul>
