<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-113460 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Classic-Creative-Food-Friends-11039-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="801" height="801" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Classic-Creative-Food-Friends-11039-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Classic-Creative-Food-Friends-11039-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Classic-Creative-Food-Friends-11039-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Classic-Creative-Food-Friends-11039-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Classic-Creative-Food-Friends-11039-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 801px) 100vw, 801px" /></p>
