					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="858" height="850" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Marvel-76338-Mech-Battle-Spider-Man-vs.-Doc-Ock-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Marvel 76338 Mech Battle Spider-Man vs. Doc Ock January 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Marvel-76338-Mech-Battle-Spider-Man-vs.-Doc-Ock-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 858w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Marvel-76338-Mech-Battle-Spider-Man-vs.-Doc-Ock-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x297.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Marvel-76338-Mech-Battle-Spider-Man-vs.-Doc-Ock-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Marvel-76338-Mech-Battle-Spider-Man-vs.-Doc-Ock-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x761.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 858px) 100vw, 858px" /></p>
<p>Good Evening LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/12-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-october-30-2026/">12 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for Tonight, October 30, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
