										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-73402 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21333-Vincent-van-Gogh-The-Starry-Night-Summer-June-2022-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="828" height="749" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21333-Vincent-van-Gogh-The-Starry-Night-Summer-June-2022-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 950w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21333-Vincent-van-Gogh-The-Starry-Night-Summer-June-2022-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x271.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21333-Vincent-van-Gogh-The-Starry-Night-Summer-June-2022-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x694.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 828px) 100vw, 828px" /></p>
<p>Some sets sit on your wish list for months. If The Endurance or Vincent van Gogh &#8211; The Starry Night has been on yours, now is a good time to take another look. Both are marked Retiring Soon at the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Store (USA)</a> but are most likely similar for other regions including at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a>,  <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO UK United Kingdom</a> and <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Australia</a>. There’s more here than display models, though, with smaller builds and sets to enjoy with the kids.</p>
<p>Our list covers everything from Star Wars and Icons to Friends and DUPLO.</p>
<h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
<ul>
<li>184 sets to browse from themes including Star Wars, Friends, Icons, and LEGO Ideas.</li>
<li>The list includes building sets only; clothing, keychains, and accessories are left out.</li>
<li>A set marked Retiring Soon is on its way out, but it may still be available to buy.</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
