		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=113997</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Icons 11387 Holiday House October 2026 Release Date Winter Village Collection Series Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>There are always exciting free LEGO activities and discussions happening at the Toys N Bricks LEGO Forums. Registration</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/two-lego-building-contests-holiday-winter-christmas-2026-scene-and-legoland-california-scene-rides-20-500-pieces-win-free-lego-set-prizes/">[Two LEGO Building Contests] Holiday Winter Christmas 2026 Scene and LEGOLAND California Scene/Rides (20-500 Pieces): Win FREE LEGO Set Prizes</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-112300 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-13.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-13.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-13-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-13-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-13-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>There are always <strong>exciting free LEGO activities</strong> and discussions happening at the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Toys N Bricks LEGO Forums</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is free and fast. Don&#8217;t forget to check your junk &amp; spam email/folder if you don&#8217;t see the registration activation email.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="648" height="517" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 648px) 100vw, 648px" /></a></p>
<p>In this forum update for <strong>Thursday night, October 29, 2026</strong>, we&#8217;ll go over the following current activities and contests happening. The Christmas holidays are coming up and we have two cool LEGO Building Contests. Yes, there will be two contests and you can win some awesome free brand-new LEGO set prizes too!</p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113653 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Bricktacular-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="693" height="461" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Bricktacular-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg 693w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Bricktacular-Banner-Ad-Logo-300x200.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 693px) 100vw, 693px" /></a></p>
<p><em>Building Contests</em></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>New! </strong><a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3337-lego-building-contest-holiday-winter-christmas-2026-sceneitemvehicle-win-october-27-to-december-13-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">[LEGO Building Contest] Holiday Winter Christmas 2026 Scene/Item/Vehicle &amp; Win: October 27 to December 13, 2026</a></li>
<li><a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3302-lego-building-contest-legoland-california-sceneridesparkattractions-20-500-pieces-win-october-16-december-5/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">[LEGO Building Contest] LEGOLAND California Scene/Rides/Park/Attractions (20-500 pieces) &amp; Win: October 16-December 5</a></li>
</ul>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">[LEGO Building Contest] Holiday Winter Christmas 2026 Scene/Item/Vehicle &amp; Win: October 27 to December 13, 2026</span></h3>
<p>Its the peak of Christmas Holiday Season. We&#8217;re excited to launch our newest Holiday Christmas 2026 LEGO Building Contest that will run from October 27 to December 13, 2026. <strong>This contest is free to enter.</strong></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112767 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Lifestyle-9.jpg" alt="" width="1046" height="697" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Lifestyle-9.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Lifestyle-9-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Lifestyle-9-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Lifestyle-9-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1046px) 100vw, 1046px" /></p>
<p>Don&#8217;t forget that we also have another <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3302-lego-building-contest-holiday-legoland-california-sceneridesparkattractions-20-500-pieces-win-october-16-december-5/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Holiday LEGOLAND California Scene/Rides/Park/Attractions (20-500 pieces)</a> that runs from October 16-December 5, 2026 as well!</p>
<p>Build a Holiday, Winter or Christmas Scene/Item/Vehicle (20-500 pieces) and you could win free LEGO set(s)!</p>
<p>Your LEGO Holiday Winter entry building creation can be as small as 20 LEGO pieces or as big as 500 pieces. <strong>Contest runs for about six weeks from now until Sunday, December 13, 2026.</strong></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-111499 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Lifestyle-3.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Lifestyle-3.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Lifestyle-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Lifestyle-3-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Lifestyle-3-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Thank you to LEGO for providing Toys N Bricks a complimentary copy of the 18+ LEGO Icons 11387 Holiday House set for our building contest. Shipping (and any US shipping tariffs/taxes if the winner is based in the US) to the grand prize winner will be paid for by Toys N Bricks.</p>
<p>For the second place prize. prizes, shipping and taxes would all be sponsored and paid for by Toys N Bricks.</p>
<ul>
<li>1st Place Prize &#8211; 18+ LEGO Icons 11387 Holiday House (retail value $119.99 USD / $169.99 CAD plus tax)</li>
<li>2nd Place Prize &#8211; LEGO 40958 Christmas Stocking (retail value $34.99 USD / $49.99 CAD plus tax)</li>
</ul>
<p>For the grand prize winner, we&#8217;ll be giving away a brand-new copy of the 18+ LEGO Icons 11387 Holiday House set (retail value $119.99 USD / $169.99 CAD plus tax). This set was released on October 4, 2026 at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Australia</a>). This set is provided by LEGO and as such, there will be no substitutions.</p>
<p>*<strong>Regrettably, <u>Toys N Bricks can only ship the grand prize 18+ LEGO Icons 11387 Holiday House set to those within US and Canada</u>. For the 2nd place prize, it can be shipped to many other countries including, but not limited to Australia, United Kingdom, Canada and United States as long as you have the LEGO Online Store in your country.</strong></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-112751 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-112769 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="953" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Back-Box-300x238.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Back-Box-1024x813.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Icons-11387-Holiday-House-October-2026-Release-Date-Winter-Village-Collection-Series-Back-Box-768x610.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>For the second place winner, we&#8217;ll be giving away a brand-new copy of the LEGO 40958 Christmas Stocking set (retail value $34.99 USD / $49.99 CAD plus tax). This set was released on October 1, 2026 at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><em>A LEGO prize value of $30 USD / $40 CAD plus tax and shipping (depending on your country of residence) would be offered to the 2nd place winner as an option instead of the </em>LEGO 40958 Christmas Stocking <em>set prize mentioned earlier (if the winners prefer an alternative LEGO set from the official LEGO store (</em><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener"><em>USA</em></a><em> | </em><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener"><em>Canada</em></a><em> | </em><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener"><em>UK</em></a><em> | </em><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener"><em>Australia</em></a><em>). Note that if the set mentioned earlier is sold out/out of stock, a LEGO prize value of $30 USD / $40 CAD plus tax and shipping would be offered (depending on your country of residence). Kindly let us know which LEGO set(s) you want and we&#8217;ll order it for you. Please note that Toys N Bricks will usually order the prizes directly from LEGO but ultimately reserves the right to order from any other big box retailer (i.e Amazon, Wal-Mart, Target, etc).</em></p>
<p><strong>To enter, you have build a Holiday Winter Christmas Scene with 20-500 LEGO brick pieces <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3337-lego-building-contest-holiday-winter-christmas-2026-sceneitemvehicle-win-october-27-to-december-13-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">in this forum topic</a>. Provide a description of why you built that. </strong></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-111490 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="817" height="817" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 817px) 100vw, 817px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-111501 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="846" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Back-Box.png 846w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Back-Box-212x300.png 212w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Back-Box-722x1024.png 722w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-40958-Christmas-Stocking-October-2026-Release-Date-Holiday-Season-Back-Box-768x1089.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 846px) 100vw, 846px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>[LEGO Building Contest] LEGOLAND California Scene/Rides/Park/Attractions (20-500 pieces) &amp; Win: October 16-December 5</strong></span></h3>
<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []">LEGOLAND (<a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a> | <a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Windsor, UK</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Billund, Denmark</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gunzburg, Germany)</a> are big theme park resorts and is definitely every LEGO fan&#8217;s dream to visit. They are great places to take your family as well as your little ones for fun filled LEGO adventures.</p>
<p>Christmas Holiday 2026 is coming up! Toys N Bricks is proud to announce our next building contest based on <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a>. <strong>This contest is free to enter. Prizes are 100% sponsored and paid for by Toys N Bricks.</strong></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ipsImage ipsRichText__align--block aligncenter" title="cropped-cropped-Description-Toysnbricksforum.com-LEGO-Forum-Discussion-with-Minifigures-and-Green-Border-Free-Membership-Reduced-Ads-650-x-108.jpg.5b07366e1b5fca07c5dde7a74db4c97b.jpg" src="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/uploads/monthly_2026_05/cropped-cropped-Description-Toysnbricksforum.com-LEGO-Forum-Discussion-with-Minifigures-and-Green-Border-Free-Membership-Reduced-Ads-650-x-108.jpg.5b07366e1b5fca07c5dde7a74db4c97b.jpg" alt="cropped-cropped-Description-Toysnbricksforum.com-LEGO-Forum-Discussion-with-Minifigures-and-Green-Border-Free-Membership-Reduced-Ads-650-x-108.jpg.5b07366e1b5fca07c5dde7a74db4c97b.jpg" width="650" height="104" data-fileid="1590" /></p>
<p>Build a Christmas/Holiday themed <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a> Scene/Hotel/Rides/Park/Attractions (20-500 pieces) and you could win free LEGO set(s)! Whether its building the LEGO Galacticoaster Holiday Spaceship or The Nutcracker Marching Band, there&#8217;s definitely something cool to build.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113655 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-California-Holiday-Christmas-Bricktacular-Theme-Park-Banner-Logo.gif" alt="" width="960" height="640" /></p>
<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []">We have some generous prizes to giveaway for the winners. Prize wise, how does 18+ LEGO IDEAS 21371 Wallace &amp; Gromit set <span style="text-decoration: underline;">OR</span> Botanicals 10371 Cozy Plants set and 40862 Holiday Ornament Selection 2 set sound? (=</p>
<p>Your Christmas/Holiday themed <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a> Scene/Hotel/Rides/Park/Attractions can be as small as 20 LEGO pieces or as big as 500 pieces. Full <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3302-lego-building-contest-legoland-california-sceneridesparkattractions-20-500-pieces-win-october-16-december-5/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">contest details available in our LEGO Forums</a>. <strong>Contest runs for about seven weeks from now until Saturday, December 5, 2026.</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113656 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Holiday-2026-Shows-Activities-Galacticoaster-Holiday-Spaceship.jpg" alt="" width="1294" height="643" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Holiday-2026-Shows-Activities-Galacticoaster-Holiday-Spaceship.jpg 1294w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Holiday-2026-Shows-Activities-Galacticoaster-Holiday-Spaceship-300x149.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Holiday-2026-Shows-Activities-Galacticoaster-Holiday-Spaceship-1024x509.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Holiday-2026-Shows-Activities-Galacticoaster-Holiday-Spaceship-768x382.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1294px) 100vw, 1294px" /></a></p>
<p>Prizes, shipping and taxes would all be sponsored and paid for by Toys N Bricks.</p>
<ul>
<li>1st Place Prize &#8211; 18+ LEGO IDEAS 21371 Wallace &amp; Gromit (retail value $99.99 USD / $139.99 CAD plus tax)</li>
<li>2nd Place Prize &#8211; LEGO Botanicals 10371 Cozy Plants (retail value $22.99 USD / $29.99 CAD plus tax) <u>AND</u> LEGO 40862 Holiday Ornament Selection 2 (retail value $12.99 CAD / $17.99 CAD plus tax)</li>
</ul>
<p>For the grand prize winner, we&#8217;ll be giving away a brand-new copy of the 18+ LEGO IDEAS 21371 Wallace &amp; Gromit set (retail value $99.99 USD / $139.99 CAD plus tax). This set was released on October 1, 2026 at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112285 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="915" height="915" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 915px) 100vw, 915px" /></p>
<p><em>A LEGO prize value of $90 USD / $125 CAD plus tax and shipping (depending on your country of residence) would be offered to the winner as an option instead of the 18+ LEGO IDEAS 21371 Wallace &amp; Gromit set prize mentioned earlier (if the winners prefer an alternative LEGO set from the official LEGO store (</em><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener"><em>USA</em></a><em> | </em><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener"><em>Canada</em></a><em> | </em><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener"><em>UK</em></a><em> | </em><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener"><em>Australia</em></a><em>). Note that if the set mentioned earlier is sold out/out of stock, a LEGO prize value of $90 USD / $125 CAD plus tax and shipping would be offered (depending on your country of residence). Kindly let us know which LEGO set(s) you want and we&#8217;ll order it for you. Please note that Toys N Bricks will usually order the prizes directly from LEGO but ultimately reserves the right to order from any other big box retailer (i.e Amazon, Wal-Mart, Target, etc).</em></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112301 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="949" height="754" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x238.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x813.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGO-IDEAS-21371-Wallace-Gromit-October-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x610.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 949px) 100vw, 949px" /></p>
<p>For the second place winner, we&#8217;ll be giving away a brand-new copy of the LEGO Botanicals 10371 Cozy Plants (retail value $22.99 USD / $29.99 CAD plus tax) <u>AND</u> LEGO 40862 Holiday Ornament Selection 2 (retail value $12.99 USD / $17.99 CAD plus tax). LEGO Botanicals 10371 Cozy Plants will be released on November 1, 2026 while LEGO 40862 Holiday Ornament Selection 2 was released on October 1, 2026 at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112635 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="629" height="732" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 629px) 100vw, 629px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112351 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="614" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 614px) 100vw, 614px" /></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><em>A LEGO prize value of $30 USD / $40 CAD plus tax and shipping (depending on your country of residence) would be offered to the winner as an option instead of the LEGO Botanicals 10371 Cozy Plants and LEGO 40862 Holiday Ornament Selection 2 set prizes mentioned earlier (if the winners prefer an alternative LEGO set from the official LEGO store (</em><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener"><em>USA</em></a><em> | </em><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener"><em>Canada</em></a><em> | </em><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener"><em>UK</em></a><em> | </em><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener"><em>Australia</em></a><em>). Note that if the set mentioned earlier is sold out/out of stock, a LEGO prize value of $30 USD / $40 CAD plus tax and shipping would be offered (depending on your country of residence). Kindly let us know which LEGO set(s) you want and we&#8217;ll order it for you. Please note that Toys N Bricks will usually order the prizes directly from LEGO but ultimately reserves the right to order from any other big box retailer (i.e Amazon, Wal-Mart, Target, etc).</em></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112644 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="604" height="703" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 604px) 100vw, 604px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112361 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="643" height="632" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Back-Box-300x295.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Back-Box-1024x1005.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-40862-Holiday-Ornament-Selection-2-October-2026-Release-Date-Christmas-Seasonal-Back-Box-768x754.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 643px) 100vw, 643px" /></p>
<p><strong>To enter, you have to build a </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>LEGOLAND California</strong></a><strong> Scene/Hotel/Rides/Park/Attractions with 20-500 LEGO brick pieces and submit the entry <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3302-lego-building-contest-holiday-legoland-california-sceneridesparkattractions-20-500-pieces-win-october-16-december-5/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">in this forum topic</a>. Provide a description of why you built that. </strong></p>
<p>Registration for a forum membership account is free and fast. Be sure to check your junk email/folder if you don&#8217;t see the activation email confirmation. Full <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3302-lego-building-contest-legoland-california-sceneridesparkattractions-20-500-pieces-win-october-16-december-5/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">contest details available in our LEGO Forums</a>.</p>
