<p><a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112959 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Forum-Renovation-Update-Revamp-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="592" height="473" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Forum-Renovation-Update-Revamp-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Forum-Renovation-Update-Revamp-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Forum-Renovation-Update-Revamp-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 592px) 100vw, 592px" /></a></p>
<p>Note that all new forum member posts are subject to moderation prior to them appearing. <span style="text-decoration: underline;">We regret that posts that are advertisements/self-promotion in nature will not be published or approved.</span> This is in the interest of safety measures as well as protecting the forum community from spam/ads/malicious links. After a certain amount of forum activity/history, new members that are not just here to advertise/self-promote would be released from post moderation. Thank you for your understanding.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109205 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Toysnbricks-Logo-Humans-First-Always-Banner-900-x150.jpg" alt="" width="900" height="150" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Toysnbricks-Logo-Humans-First-Always-Banner-900-x150.jpg 900w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Toysnbricks-Logo-Humans-First-Always-Banner-900-x150-300x50.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Toysnbricks-Logo-Humans-First-Always-Banner-900-x150-768x128.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></p>
<p>With that said, we <span style="text-decoration: underline;">do allow self-promotion/advertisements to be posted</span> if you have <a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener">subscribed to our Patreon Platinum Elite Tier or VIP Signature Tier</a>. Funds received will be used to support Toys N Bricks Forum Community Activities (i.e Building Contests &amp; Giveaways) as well as operational expenses. Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
<p>Toys N Bricks is free of charge to everyone. If you appreciate and like the work that we do at Toys N Bricks, you can <a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener">subscribe to our Patreon monthly financial support</a> starting as low as $3 USD/month. Thank you for your support.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.patreon.com/toysnbricks/membership" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-111285 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks.jpg" alt="" width="697" height="253" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks.jpg 697w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Patreon-Creator-Logo-Banner-Support-Toys-N-Bricks-300x109.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 697px) 100vw, 697px" /></a></p>
