					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="823" height="503" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10-Handpicked-Best-Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Deals-Sales-List-for-Tonight-October-29-2026-72043-76463-40460-75433-76975-77256-43217-21034-43249-42666.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="10 Handpicked Best Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, October 29, 2026 72043 76463 40460 75433 76975 77256 43217 21034 43249 42666" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10-Handpicked-Best-Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Deals-Sales-List-for-Tonight-October-29-2026-72043-76463-40460-75433-76975-77256-43217-21034-43249-42666.jpg 823w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10-Handpicked-Best-Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Deals-Sales-List-for-Tonight-October-29-2026-72043-76463-40460-75433-76975-77256-43217-21034-43249-42666-300x183.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10-Handpicked-Best-Wal-Mart-Canada-LEGO-Deals-Sales-List-for-Tonight-October-29-2026-72043-76463-40460-75433-76975-77256-43217-21034-43249-42666-768x469.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 823px) 100vw, 823px" /></p>
<p>We are back today on October 29, 2026 with more LEGO deals on Wal-Mart Canada Online. Note that</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/10-handpicked-best-wal-mart-canada-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-october-29-2026/">10 Handpicked Best Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for Tonight, October 29, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>We are back today on October 29, 2026 with more LEGO deals on <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a>. Note that <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada</a> did not list the regular price for a lot of them. But we did check them with <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> and calculated the actual savings percentage for your convenience. Free shipping on orders above $35 for items sold by Wal-Mart Canada (free shipping not available for remote areas or for orders over 150lbs).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-102826 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76463-Hogwarts-Castle-Hospital-Wing-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="612" height="855" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76463-Hogwarts-Castle-Hospital-Wing-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 612w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76463-Hogwarts-Castle-Hospital-Wing-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-215x300.jpg 215w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 612px) 100vw, 612px" /></p>
<p>I like LEGO Harry Potter Hogwarts Castle: Hospital Wing 76463. This set is big enough to include all the signature details from Harry Potter: 7 main characters minifigures, Ravenclaw common room, DADA classroom, and Remus Lupin’s Wolf Patronus. After the discount, the price is only $84.52 for 907 pieces. Besides Harry Potter set, you can discover more great deals at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a> below.</p>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in Canada by subscribing to our email list.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">10 Handpicked Best Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, October 29, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>34% off &#8211; LEGO Super Mario Mario Kart – Interactive LEGO Mario &amp; Standard Kart 72043 <strong>$42.72</strong> &#8211; <em>Regular retail price is $64.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> </em></li>
<li><strong>Shop Now:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-97048 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-72043-Mario-Kart-–-Interactive-LEGO-Mario-Standard-Kart-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="858" height="841" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-72043-Mario-Kart-–-Interactive-LEGO-Mario-Standard-Kart-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 858w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-72043-Mario-Kart-–-Interactive-LEGO-Mario-Standard-Kart-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x294.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-72043-Mario-Kart-–-Interactive-LEGO-Mario-Standard-Kart-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x753.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 858px) 100vw, 858px" /></p>
