<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-94757 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/LEGO-Jurassic-World-Rebirth-76975-T.-rex-River-Escape-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="928" height="880" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/LEGO-Jurassic-World-Rebirth-76975-T.-rex-River-Escape-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 928w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/LEGO-Jurassic-World-Rebirth-76975-T.-rex-River-Escape-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x284.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/LEGO-Jurassic-World-Rebirth-76975-T.-rex-River-Escape-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x728.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 928px) 100vw, 928px" /></p>
