					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="963" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Jurassic World 77982 Spinosaurus Dinosaur Escape August 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x241.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x822.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x616.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Good Thursday Afternoon LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for this afternoon. Free shipping on</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/10-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-afternoon-october-29-2026/">10 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Afternoon, October 29, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
